    "text": "RE-ESTABLISHMENT OF HEALTH MANAGEMENT ASSISTANT SERVICE",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      352.09,
      539.96,
      387.16
    ],
    "text": "THE Health Management Assistant Service which was declared by the Gazette No. bearing 1355/15 dated 25.08.2004 andamalgamated to Public Management Assistant Service is hereby re-established with effect from 02.12.2015 with theapproval of the Cabinet of Ministers.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      400.09,
      540.0,
      423.16
    ],
    "text": "All the actions taken in respect of the officers of this service who were governed under the Public ManagementAssistant Service during 15.10.2009 to 02.12.2015 shall be valid and intact.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      436.09,
      540.04,
      459.16
    ],
    "text": "The rest of the clauses of the minute on Health Management Assistant Service dated 25.08.2004 shall be intactand valid.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
